        "q_products_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where can I find dimensions, materials and care details?",
            "answer": "<p>Every product page has sections for <strong>Dimensions</strong>, <strong>Materials</strong>, <strong>Care and Maintenance</strong> and <strong>Additional Details</strong> just below the Add to Cart button. If a detail you need is missing, email <a href=\"mailto:info@norafurnish.com\">info@norafurnish.com</a> and we will check it for you.</p>",
            "keywords": "dimensions size measurements materials care clean specifications details",
            "anchor": "",
            "show_payment_icons": false
          }
        },
        "q_products_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is the mounting hardware included?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. All required hardware and assembly instructions are included. Decorative accessories and items styled in the product photos are not included with your purchase.</p>",
            "keywords": "hardware screws mounting assembly instructions included in the box",
            "anchor": "",
            "show_payment_icons": false
          }
        },
        "q_products_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which voltage should I choose?",
            "answer": "<p>Many of our lights come in two voltage options. Homes in the United States run on 110 to 120 volts, so choose the <strong>100V to 120V</strong> option whenever a listing asks.</p>",
            "keywords": "voltage 110v 120v 220v 240v electrical plug power",
            "anchor": "",
            "show_payment_icons": false
          }
        },
        "q_products_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I need an electrician to install my light?",
            "answer": "<p>Hardwired fixtures such as chandeliers, pendants, flush mounts and wall sconces connect to your home wiring, so we recommend a licensed electrician for those. Plug in, battery, solar and rechargeable lights need no wiring.</p>",
            "keywords": "install installation electrician hardwired wiring plug in",
            "anchor": "",
            "show_payment_icons": false
          }
        },
        "q_products_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will the color match the product photos?",
            "answer": "<p>We make every effort to show colors and finishes accurately, but every screen displays color a little differently, and natural materials can vary slightly from piece to piece. The Materials section on each product lists the available finishes.</p>",
            "keywords": "color colour finish photo match looks different screen",
            "anchor": "",
            "show_payment_icons": false
          }
        },
