            "answer": "<p>Yes. We help with lighting ideas for hospitality, office, retail, home and outdoor projects, from a single room to a whole building. See our <a href=\"/pages/professionals\">Professionals</a> page, and browse design ideas in our <a href=\"/pages/project-portfolio\">Project Portfolio</a>.</p>",
            "keywords": "designer trade hotel restaurant office retail business commercial project contractor",
